{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117966","id":3462463451,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7OYP_b","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117966","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117966.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117966.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117966","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117966/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117966/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117966/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/61200124172b7be8884d5662a9c33151eb36fdb3","number":117966,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Fix parameter hint highlighting for vararg annotations","user":{"login":"Lidang-Jiang","id":119769478,"node_id":"U_kgDOByOJhg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119769478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang","html_url":"https://github.com/Lidang-Jiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lidang-Jiang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #117927.\n\nWhen typing arguments for vararg annotations like `@export_enum`, the parameter hint highlighting was incorrect — it stopped highlighting after the last declared parameter index, even though the annotation accepts additional arguments.\n\n**Changes in `_make_arguments_hint`:**\n\n- For vararg annotations: the last declared parameter now displays with a `...` prefix (e.g., `...names: String`) and stays highlighted for all argument indices >= the last parameter index.\n- For non-annotation vararg methods (e.g., `print()`): behavior is unchanged, still using the existing `...args: Array` fallback.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Before</summary>\n\nFor `@export_enum(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\")`:\n- Typing 1st arg `\"A\"` → `names: String` highlighted ✅\n- Typing 2nd arg `\"B\"` → no parameter highlighted ❌\n- Typing 3rd arg `\"C\"` → no parameter highlighted ❌\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>After</summary>\n\nFor `@export_enum(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\")`:\n- Typing 1st arg `\"A\"` → `...names: String` highlighted ✅\n- Typing 2nd arg `\"B\"` → `...names: String` highlighted ✅\n- Typing 3rd arg `\"C\"` → `...names: String` highlighted ✅\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n**AI disclosure:** AI tooling (Claude Code) was used to assist with writing and reviewing the code. All modifications were reviewed and tested by the author.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archi